WEBVTT

00:00:08,910 --> 00:00:16,910
My husband is suddenly having some wheezy again and I'm wondering if a nebulizer and hydrogen

00:00:18,030 --> 00:00:26,110
peroxide will be helpful. I read that it may not be a good idea with a collapse lung as you know

00:00:26,110 --> 00:00:31,630
he had a slight collapse or is there something else that you would recommend? He is already taking

00:00:31,630 --> 00:00:41,870
mullin. So mullin is a great thing to help clear congestion in a lung. Typically wheezy can

00:00:41,870 --> 00:00:50,270
be caused from a constrictor of the bronchioles or the bronchioli, the smaller bronchioles

00:00:50,990 --> 00:01:03,070
and that can be due to an allergy wheezy is common asma type symptoms. Typically you won't get a wheezy

00:01:03,070 --> 00:01:12,990
so much with a collapse lung or pneumonia but mullin can still be a good thing. Cortiseps can be good,

00:01:12,990 --> 00:01:20,990
anacetyl cysteine can be good to help clear the lung and certainly nebulizing with hydrogen peroxide

00:01:20,990 --> 00:01:36,830
and that hydrogen peroxide recipe is on the homepage of the member's site. Trying all those things.

